---
/**
 * Localized "Minecraft mod launcher" landing page. Brand names left
 * untranslated (GDLauncher, CurseForge, Modrinth, Forge, Fabric, NeoForge,
 * Quilt, Sodium, Lithium, Overwolf). Modpack names stay in English
